<h3><u>chal sakina chalein karbala</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><big>haay haay haay<br>haay haay sakina<br><br>jaago ay baali sakina<br>dete hain aawaaz baba<br><br>ek shab sakina shaam ke zindaan me so gayi<br>baba ko dekha khwaab me kehte the wo yehi<br>bohat ro chuki meri jaan jaag jaa<br><br>chal sakina chalein karbala<br>saath baba ke rehna sada<br><br>mujh se bichhri to soyi nahin meri jaan<br>ek&nbsp; ek saans tum par thi kohe garaan<br>aur us par sitam qaid ki sakhtiyaan<br>teri aah o buka par bhi paabandiyaan<br>is liye kar raha hun buka<br><br>chal sakina chalein karbala<br>saath baba ke rehna sada<br><br>hai yahaan sirf tanhaayi taarikiyaan<br>ye ghutan aur taqdeer ki beriyaan<br>chaahne waale tere to sab hain wahaan<br>chain aata hai apnon ke hi darmiyaan<br>chhor kar ab ye shehre jafa<br><br>chal sakina chalein karbala<br>saath baba ke rehna sada<br><br>yaad karta hai asghar tujhe meri jaan<br>tujh ko aawaaz deta hai wo bezabaan<br>wo wahaan reh gaya aagayi tu yahaan<br>wo wahaan nohakhwaan tu yahaan nohakhwaan<br>chain donon ko aa jaayega<br><br>chal sakina chalein karbala<br>saath baba ke rehna sada<br><br>saath apne tujhe leke jaawunga mein<br>tere ammu se tujh ko milaawunga mein<br>haan tujhe baaliyaan bhi pinhaawunga mein<br>apne sine pe tujh ko sulaawunga mein<br>hai wahaan par jahaan ek naya<br><br>chal sakina chalein karbala<br>saath baba ke rehna sada<br><br>ab na talwaar o neza hai na teer hai<br>karbala ab to ghazi ki jaageer hai<br>tere baba ke khwaabon ki taabeer hai<br>ek aagosh hai jis me besheer hai<br>dil ye tera behel jaayega<br><br>chal sakina chalein karbala<br>saath baba ke rehna sada<br><br>shaam se mukhtalif hai wahaan ki fizaa<br>kon tujh par wahaan ab karega jafa<br>tera akbar bhi hai aur tere chacha<br>saare pehron se aazaad hai alqamah<br>ab to paani bhi mil jaayega<br><br>chal sakina chalein karbala<br>saath baba ke rehna sada<br><br>ghurkiyaan taaziyaane tamaache lage<br>qaid khaane me tujh par sitam jo huwe<br>tera baba tarapta hai is dard se<br>chaahta hun dukhon se rehaayi mile<br>saath baba ke ay ghamzada<br><br>chal sakina chalein karbala<br>saath baba ke rehna sada<br><br>zakhm saare jigar ke dikhaane chalo<br>apne dukhre chacha ko sunaane chalo<br>jo sitam tum ne jhele bataane chalo<br>khaake karbal ko marham banaane chalo<br>saare zakhmon ki lene dawa<br><br>chal sakina chalein karbala<br>saath baba ke rehna sada<br><br>yun to har roz ""farhan"" o ""mazhar"" yun hi<br>baap se bachchi milti thi khwaabon me hi<br>zindagi ka yehi khwaab tha aakhri<br>yun laga saath baba ke wo laadli<br>chal basi sun ke bas ye sada<br><br>chal sakina chalein karbala<br>saath baba ke rehna sada</big></p>
               
